  "notes_for_editor": "The build year (1933) and destruction year (1954) agree across three site sources; the Idaho County list gives c.1933. Elevation 3,823 ft and the 30-foot height come from site sources. No source names any staffing, and none describes the site today. The Idaho Fire Lookouts drive-up tag is their label, not a verified access status, so access level is unset. Not listed in the 2010 Nez Perce list (fs.usda.gov/media/259204). The 1933 USFS drawings PDF on firelookout.org gave no extractable text, so L-4 is not defined in the story. The record had no events; built and destroyed were added. No new photos.",
